  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nat 301.01 “Accreditation Commission for Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine (ACAOM)” means a national entity recognized by the United States department of education as the accrediting body for professional educational programs in acupuncture and oriental medicine.\n\nSource. #6380, eff 11-26-96, EXPIRED: 11-26-04\n\nNew. #8374, eff 6-18-05, EXPIRED: 6-18-13\n\nNew. #12176, eff 5-17-17",
